{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["^You're in. Three contacts share that house: Ahmed, Baptiste and Novak.","\n","^On the night of the leak, someone handed our network to the cult.","\n","^Here's what to look for. A cult-issued burner. There's one in circulation.","\n","^Or anyone who went out to the quarry site and can't prove where they were that night.","\n","^Trust no one.","\n","^Your keycard opens the bedroom and the comms room. The office has a code. The garage only takes Novak's badge.","\n","^When you're done, the exit phone in the lounge calls extraction.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"hub":[["ev","str","^About getting out.","/str",{"VAR?":"c_pull_out"},{"VAR?":"c_leaving"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"deduction_closed"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":5},"ev","str","^Lock the comms room with whoever is waiting inside.","/str",{"VAR?":"c_waiting_ded_c_ahmed"},{"VAR?":"c_waiting_ded_c_novak"},"||",{"VAR?":"c_waiting_ded_c_baptiste"},"||",{"VAR?":"c_comms_locked"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"deduction_closed"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":5},"ev","str","^My keycard's dead. I still need the office.","/str",{"VAR?":"c_keycard_revoked"},{"VAR?":"office_code_given"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"deduction_closed"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":5},"ev","str","^Has anyone complained about me?","/str",{"VAR?":"ded_c_baptiste_reported"},{"VAR?":"reported_heard"},"!","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":5},"ev","str","^Where do things stand?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":4},"ev","str","^Remind me what we're looking for.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":4},"ev","str","^Nothing for now.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-6","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"pull_out"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"lock_confirm"},null],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"office_code"},null],"c-3":["\n",{"->":"reported"},null],"c-4":["\n",{"->":"status"},null],"c-5":["\n",{"->":"profile"},null],"c-6":["\n","^Then stop calling me and get on with it.","\n","#","^exit_conversation","/#",{"->":"hub"},null]}],null],"profile":["^A cult-issued burner. There's one out there.","\n","^Or a trip to the quarry site with no verified alibi for the night of the leak.","\n","^Either one is enough.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"status":[["ev",{"VAR?":"deduction_closed"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^It's done. Extraction has you.","\n",{"->":"status.6"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"c_comms_locked"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^The comms room is locked. Use the exit phone when you're ready.","\n",{"->":"status.6"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"c_waiting_ded_c_ahmed"},{"VAR?":"c_waiting_ded_c_novak"},"||",{"VAR?":"c_waiting_ded_c_baptiste"},"||","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Someone's waiting in the comms room. Lock it when you're sure, or leave it open.","\n",{"->":"status.6"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"se_intel_c_novak_alibi"},{"VAR?":"se_intel_c_ahmed_alibi"},"&&","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You've read the door log. Decide, then deal with them.","\n",{"->":"status.6"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"c_keycard_revoked"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^No keycard, so you need the office code from me, or someone to open doors for you.","\n",{"->":"status.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Their kit, their trips, their alibis. Records tell you more than they will.","\n",{"->":"status.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"office_code":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"office_code_given","re":true},"^Five, one, eight, three. That's all you get from me now.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"reported":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"reported_heard","re":true},"^Baptiste rang me. Says you lean on people. Lean less.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"lock_confirm":[["^Once it's locked, it stays locked until extraction opens it. Whoever's inside goes with them.","\n","ev","str","^Lock it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Not yet. Leave it open.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Locked. They're not going anywhere. ","#","^set_global:c_comms_locked:true","